      },
      "text": "Why you'll beat competition is often not as clean cut as investors like to believe.\n\nIt's not usually \"our tech does X so we'll win\".\n\nThe real answer is usually whoever has the best team who is able to, in perpetuity, do things in the most novel &amp; efficient ways will win.",
