      },
      "text": "For our next AI Futures interview, I spoke with @jeremyphoward—founder of https://t.co/4eERidpqIg.\n\nWe discussed his work making neural networks more accessible at @fastdotai, and the real problems with AI today.\n\nWatch here:\n\nhttps://t.co/Lx977CzrxD",
