          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "4/ Pay attention to the criticisms (often there is some truth to them), but don't let them shake you.\n\nIf you want to win, you absolutely cannot lose your resolve.\n\nGood luck.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1158763624959102983"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "conversation_id": "1158763622815846401",
      "created_at": "2019-08-06T15:35:51.000Z",
      "display_text_range": [
