          "id": "1158763623604293633",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "3/ Remember and amplify your deep belief about why you're doing what you're doing.\n\nI knew that labeled data really mattered for the next 20 years, and I knew I could do it better than how it was done today.\n\nGood ideas are especially good if few people agree. It's really true.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1158763624325738496"
    },
