          "id": "1158763622815846401",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "2/ One investor friend told our early engineer that Scale was a horrible co to join. No chance of outsized success.\n\nOne of my old bosses wrote on social media about how Scale was destined to fail.\n\nThese aren't isolated incidents.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1158763623604293633"
    },
